==Swedish==
{{wikipedia|lang=sv}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sv|non|skítr}}, from {{inh|sv|gem-pro|*skītaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*skitiz}}. Cognate with {{cog|da|skid}}, {{cog|is|skítur}}, {{cog|nl|schijt}}, {{cog|de|Scheiße}} and {{cog|en|shit}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|sv|Sv-skit.ogg}}
* {{IPA|sv|/ˈɧiːt/}}

===Noun===
{{sv-noun|c}}

# {{lb|sv|vulgar}} [[shit]] (excrement)
#: {{syn|sv|bajs|avföring|exkrement|fekalier|träck|dret}}
#: {{ux|sv|Det är '''skit''' på mattan|There's '''shit''' on the carpet}}
#: {{ux|sv|Det luktar '''skit''' här inne|It smells like '''shit''' in here}}
# {{lb|sv|colloquial|vulgar}} [[crap]], [[shit]] (undesirable material)
#: {{ux|sv|Ta bort den där '''skiten''' från skrivbordet|Get that '''crap''' off the desk}}
# {{lb|sv|colloquial|vulgar}} [[shit]] (something or someone undesirable or disagreeable, more generally)
#: {{ux|sv|Jag börjar tröttna på den här '''skiten'''|I'm getting tired of this '''shit'''}}
#: {{ux|sv|Du är bara en liten '''skit'''|You're just a little '''shit'''}}
# {{lb|sv|colloquial|vulgar}} {{ng|(something) very bad (in adjectival and adverbial usage)}}
#: {{syn|sv|piss}}
#: {{ux|sv|Filmen var '''skit'''|The movie was '''shit'''}}
#: {{ux|sv|Det här smakar '''skit'''|This tastes '''like shit'''}}
# {{lb|sv|in the definite}} the [[shit]] (as an intensifier)
#: {{ux|sv|banka '''skiten''' ur någon|beat '''the shit''' out of someone}}
# {{lb|sv|colloquial|vulgar|in negations}} [[shit]] (anything)
#: {{syn|sv|piss|dugg|dyft|jota|skvatt|smack}}
#: {{ux|sv|Jag förstår inte '''ett skit'''|I don't understand '''shit'''}}

====Usage notes====
Note that you "don't understand a shit" rather than "don't understand shit" in Swedish.

